Package: com.chatgpt.globalfpsoverlay
Name: GlobalFPSOverlay
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lightweight global CADisplayLink FPS overlay for jailbroken iOS 13 devices. Shows per-process display-link cadence and the screen maximum frame rate in UIKit apps and SpringBoard.
Maintainer: ChatGPT + user test build
Author: ChatGPT + user test build
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 13.0), mobilesubstrate | org.coolstar.libhooker
